comfyui-readable-node

This skill reads ComfyUI workflows the way the ComfyUI frontend loads them, so its reading code
reproduces the frontend's behaviour (subgraph expansion, widget value order, legacy group nodes,
node sizes). That behaviour was checked against prompts produced by the running frontend; no frontend
source code is included.

skills/comfyui-readable-node/scripts/ue.py reproduces the link rules of the Anything Everywhere custom nodes
(cg-use-everywhere by chrisgoringe, Apache License 2.0). It was written from a description of
that behaviour; no source code of that project is included.

skills/comfyui-readable-node/scripts/fonts/PlusJakartaSans-latin.woff2 is Plus Jakarta Sans (Latin subset), embedded in the replay page.
